### 1. Login as Organizer (to get auth cookie / token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "programminggakenye@gmail.com",
  "password": "Gakenye123#"
}

### 2. Get All Venues for Logged-in Organizer
GET {{baseUrl}}/venues
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: auth_token={{token}}

### 3. Search Venues by Name
GET {{baseUrl}}/venues/search?q=Main
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: auth_token={{token}}

### 4. Create a New Venue (Validated with Zod & Scoped to orgId)
POST {{baseUrl}}/venues
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: auth_token={{token}}

{
  "name": "KICC Tsavo Ballroom",
  "location": "Nairobi CBD",
  "address": "City Square, Harambee Avenue",
  "capacity": 4500,
  "description": "Main convention and events center"
}

### 5. Get Venue By Name
GET {{baseUrl}}/venues/KICC%20Tsavo%20Ballroom
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: auth_token={{token}}

### 6. Get Venue Details including Events
GET {{baseUrl}}/details/venues/search?name=KICC%20Tsavo%20Ballroom
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: auth_token={{token}}

### 7. Update an Existing Venue (Replace 1 with actual venue ID)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/venues/3
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: auth_token={{token}}

{
  "name": "KICC Main Auditorium",
  "capacity": 5000
}

### 8. Delete an Existing Venue (Replace 1 with actual venue ID)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/venues/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: auth_token={{token}}